{"id":"28c39f1dc8b3e62b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-implicitly-definable.md","title":"Implicitly Definable","display":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-implicitly-definable","aliases":["92-df-implicitly-definable"],"display":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable","depends_on":["[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]"],"source":"原书之外的一阶模型论背景；未以给定 PDF 作为 Beth 定理证明","source_status":"外部背景定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-implicitly-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-implicitly-definable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implicitly-definable — Implicitly Definable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的一阶模型论背景；未以给定 PDF 作为 Beth 定理证明"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\">\\(L&#39;\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的关系符号集加入新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，并给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(P)=r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a_R(P)=r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\models_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\)</span> (definition-target implicit-definability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicitly\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\n\\Longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak M}=P^{\\mathfrak N}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicitly\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models_{L&#39;}T\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\n\\Longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak M}=P^{\\mathfrak N}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>隐式可定义：唯一满足条件</li>\n<li>不直接给出定义公式</li>\n<li>给出条件，唯一集合满足</li>\n<li>等式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\\)</span>同时固定共同底集与全部旧符号解释；比较的是同一<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构上的两个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-扩张</li>\n<li>隐式定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neq\">\\(\\neq\\)</span>显式定义</li>\n<li>一阶Beth可定义性定理说明：在标准一阶语义下，上述相对于理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的隐式可定义性蕴含由某个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-公式显式定义；跨越到二阶语义或其他逻辑时不能直接套用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$；$L'$ 仅在 $L$ 的关系符号集加入新符号 $P$，并给定 $a_R(P)=r\\in\\mathbb N$，见[[92-df-first-order-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}$ (theory, see [[92-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}$ (structure class, see [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_{L'}$ (satisfaction relation, see [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L'","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(P)=r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicitly\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_T(P/L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L'}T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models_{L'}T\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L\n\\Longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak M}=P^{\\mathfrak N}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\neq","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1872,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-implicitly-definable]]"}],"outgoing":["b230b875687723ed","0b146f0add46bd47"]}